  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While chasing Fang Yuan, Feng Jiu Ge already holds seven songs by Fang Yuan’s previous-life count. Four are offensive (Green Jade Song, heaven and earth song, Submission Song, and Separation Song); obtain treasure and towards heaven assist cultivation and are not Fang Yuan’s concern in that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1421
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "move_green_jade_song",
        "move_submission_song",
        "move_separation_song"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Night Temptress defends while Immortal Concubine Qing Lan finishes the immortal formation and takes out Pass Gu. Pass Gu is the core of this immortal formation; it activates and goes into the yellow sand. Feng Jiu Ge names himself the creator: even though he created obtain treasure song, which can refine wild Immortal Gu, in that situation the chances of getting Pass Gu are too low.",
      "chapters": [
        1423
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_night_temptress",
        "char_immortal_concubine_qing_lan",
        "gu_pass_immortal_gu",
        "sys_wild_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among seven songs then held, obtain treasure song and towards heaven song assist cultivation; green jade song, heaven and earth song, submission song, and separation song are fight trump cards; he would not use Assimilation Wind Song unless necessary.",
      "chapters": [
        1546
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seven-songs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_assimilation_wind_song"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Lang Ya blessed land he sees wild rank nine Wisdom Gu and activates obtain treasure song with unprecedented force, erupting with rank eight might. The song is warm and kind, filled with a peaceful aura; as he sings, Wisdom Gu fluttering between tree branches becomes still. An obtain treasure song warrior flies toward Wisdom Gu while other song warriors block the immortal formation. Wisdom Gu is rank nine; obtain treasure song is only rank eight and cannot affect it.",
      "chapters": [
        1548
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
